00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.910
it was about to come out, it was like,

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:09.030
it's not gonna be anything
like season one, loved it!

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.707
Like it was better than season
one, that rarely happens.

00:00:11.707 --> 00:00:12.667
(audience cheering)

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:14.029
Rarely happens.

00:00:14.029 --> 00:00:14.862
- Thank you.

00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:17.080
- I loved the new additions.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.390
I loved y'all, the sisters coming.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:19.370
I loved all of it.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.510
I love the whole new story,

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:22.030
I loved the diverse cast,

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.050
I loved that.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.510
