either while you were shooting,

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.330
maybe something we
didn't know that happened

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.650
or just a part of the show.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:39.470
- Ooh, I think my favorite scene to shoot

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:42.186
from season two was the
Holi scene in episode six.

00:00:42.186 --> 00:00:43.019
- Yeah.

00:00:43.019 --> 00:00:44.530
- Just because, you know, I think

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:47.260
you never really know how
people are gonna react

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.370
to certain scenes, right?

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:49.998
Like you hope for the best
and you can feel passionate.

00:00:49.998 --> 00:00:52.724
But when we were feeling, when
we were filming that scene,

00:00:52.724 --> 00:00:55.780
I think all of us, including the crew

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.900
felt this sense of like, oh my goodness,

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.180
we're kind of making history,

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.720
I don't think we've ever seen

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.630
something like this on screen before.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.810
- Yeah.
- And it looked very different

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:06.997
to other scenes in the show.
- Yeah.

00:01:06.997 --> 00:01:09.730
- And so it's really special to me

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:11.810
'cause it just feels so monumental.

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.410
- Yeah, something like new and fresh

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:14.354
as well.
- Yeah.

00:01:14.354 --> 00:01:15.187
- That should have been happening.

00:01:15.187 --> 00:01:16.850
- Yeah.
- Yeah, I like that.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:17.820
What's your favorite?

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.180
